{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/common/pokepicnic_cookinfo.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/common/pokepicnic_cookinfo.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_01",
      "hash64": "E49F22D8268DC8EF",
      "text": "馅料仅有火腿和黄油的简单三明治。\\n正因为其朴素，所以偷工减料定会被识破。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_02",
      "hash64": "E49F23D8268DCAA2",
      "text": "在火腿黄油三明治中加入了苦味。\\n要是爱吃苦味，可不能错过。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_03",
      "hash64": "E49F24D8268DCC55",
      "text": "在火腿黄油三明治中加入了甜味。\\n想品尝极品甜味就该吃这个。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_04",
      "hash64": "E49F1DD8268DC070",
      "text": "在火腿黄油三明治中加入了咸味。\\n虽然咸味极其浓厚，但确实美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_05",
      "hash64": "E49F1ED8268DC223",
      "text": "在火腿黄油三明治中加入了酸味。\\n酸味突出，齿颊留香。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_06",
      "hash64": "E49F1FD8268DC3D6",
      "text": "在火腿黄油三明治中加入了辣味。\\n没吃过这款三明治都不能说自己爱吃辣。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_07",
      "hash64": "E49F20D8268DC589",
      "text": "被称为苦味之极致的三明治。\\n加调味料时不能手软。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_08",
      "hash64": "E49F29D8268DD4D4",
      "text": "面向会吃的人，能享受咸味的三明治。\\n吃的时候必须准备饮料。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_09",
      "hash64": "E49F2AD8268DD687",
      "text": "甜得吓人的三明治。\\n秘诀是要多下调味料。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_10",
      "hash64": "E4A2A7D82690E0C5",
      "text": "为酸味爱好者献上的三明治。\\n调味料越新鲜，酸味越强。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_11",
      "hash64": "E4A2A6D82690DF12",
      "text": "辣得会刺痛舌头的辛辣三明治。\\n不擅长辣味的人可要注意了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_12",
      "hash64": "E4A2A5D82690DD5F",
      "text": "馅料仅有果酱和草莓的三明治。\\n正因为其朴素，所以是百吃不腻的佳肴。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_13",
      "hash64": "E4A2A4D82690DBAC",
      "text": "通过添加酸奶突出甜味，\\n让整个口感与味道更加有深度了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_14",
      "hash64": "E4A2A3D82690D9F9",
      "text": "份量十足，作为正餐或是点心都适合。\\n凤梨选择甜味强烈的为佳。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_15",
      "hash64": "E4A2A2D82690D846",
      "text": "通过调味料让所有馅料\\n化为一体的完美三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_16",
      "hash64": "E4A2A1D82690D693",
      "text": "花生酱与香蕉的组合意外地搭配，\\n吃完让人果腹感十足。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_17",
      "hash64": "E4A2A0D82690D4E0",
      "text": "加入了黄油，成功让这款\\n三明治拥有了扎实的口感。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_18",
      "hash64": "E4A2AFD82690EE5D",
      "text": "通过加入果酱的甜味，\\n这款三明治带来的果腹感更高了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_19",
      "hash64": "E4A2AED82690ECAA",
      "text": "故意加入辣味，让这款\\n三明治神奇地让人上瘾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_20",
      "hash64": "E4A62DD82693FA4E",
      "text": "极为简单的三明治。\\n希望能在橄榄油上特别讲究。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_21",
      "hash64": "E4A62ED82693FC01",
      "text": "这款三明治中酸黄瓜的酸味和\\n豆瓣菜的风味，相衬得如微风般舒服。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_22",
      "hash64": "E4A62BD82693F6E8",
      "text": "由于加入了罗勒，这款\\n三明治的风味变得有层次了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_23",
      "hash64": "E4A62CD82693F89B",
      "text": "简单健康的三明治。\\n酸味强劲，后劲十足。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_24",
      "hash64": "E4A631D82694011A",
      "text": "朴实且价格实惠，却不失美味，\\n切薄烤香增添风味也甚佳。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_25",
      "hash64": "E4A632D8269402CD",
      "text": "这款三明治通过油的甜味突出了酸味。\\n要小心不要放太多黄油了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_26",
      "hash64": "E4A62FD82693FDB4",
      "text": "橘子酱的酸味越强就越好吃。\\n吃这款三明治时要稍微注意卡路里。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_27",
      "hash64": "E4A630D82693FF67",
      "text": "画龙点睛的咸味左右其整体味道。\\n这款三明治建立在一种恰到好处的平衡上。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_28",
      "hash64": "E4A625D82693ECB6",
      "text": "加入了带香草芳香的香肠\\n与番茄酱的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_29",
      "hash64": "E4A626D82693EE69",
      "text": "黄芥末酱的酸味与辣味\\n让这款三明治味道层次丰富。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_30",
      "hash64": "E4A933D826963A57",
      "text": "这款三明治的馅料由新鲜蔬菜与\\n香肠组成，绝对不会难吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_31",
      "hash64": "E4A932D8269638A4",
      "text": "这款三明治拥有最主流的美味。\\n苦味让馅料的味道融为一体。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_32",
      "hash64": "E4A935D826963DBD",
      "text": "馅料配搭奇异的三明治。\\n咖喱粉最好用火轻轻一烤。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_33",
      "hash64": "E4A934D826963C0A",
      "text": "虽然加入了辣味让这款三明治\\n更容易入口，但喜恶还是得看吃的人。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_34",
      "hash64": "E4A92FD82696338B",
      "text": "靠番茄的鲜味变得更加容易入口，\\n但喜不喜欢这款三明治还是要看人。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_35",
      "hash64": "E4A92ED8269631D8",
      "text": "拥有强烈辣味，非常刺激的三明治。\\n其组合一如既往的充满了野心。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_36",
      "hash64": "E4A931D8269636F1",
      "text": "最合适当作点心的三明治。\\n用甜甜的酸奶做成。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_37",
      "hash64": "E4A930D82696353E",
      "text": "奇异果的绿色十分美丽，\\n不仅好吃还养眼的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_38",
      "hash64": "E4A92BD826962CBF",
      "text": "这款三明治内夹有３款水果，\\n十分惹人喜爱。冰镇再吃也是极品。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_39",
      "hash64": "E4A92AD826962B0C",
      "text": "简直能称之为完美的点心三明治。\\n调味料不需多，足以提味即可。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_40",
      "hash64": "E491A9D8268270F8",
      "text": "酸味与鲜美的平衡是其关键，\\n多下橘子酱是其成功的秘诀。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_41",
      "hash64": "E491AAD8268272AB",
      "text": "全靠凤梨给这款三明治带来了\\n热带的感觉，酸味越强越是美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_42",
      "hash64": "E491ABD82682745E",
      "text": "感觉到异国风情的三明治。\\n加入辣味让味道有了深度。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_43",
      "hash64": "E491ACD826827611",
      "text": "不失热带之名的三明治。\\n通过调味料统一了味道。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_44",
      "hash64": "E491ADD8268277C4",
      "text": "味道会随牛油果的后熟程度而变化，\\n是一款让人永远吃不腻的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_45",
      "hash64": "E491AED826827977",
      "text": "味道实在的三明治。\\n馅料适合任何人，绝不会错。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_46",
      "hash64": "E491AFD826827B2A",
      "text": "实在又好吃的三明治。馅料组合\\n绝不会难吃，味道让人安心。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_47",
      "hash64": "E491B0D826827CDD",
      "text": "味道稳定得堪称完美的三明治。\\n咸味足够，实在美味哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_48",
      "hash64": "E491A1D826826360",
      "text": "既不知道何时流行起来，也不知道\\n食谱出自何人，充满谜团的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_49",
      "hash64": "E491A2D826826513",
      "text": "能令人很有饱腹感的三明治。\\n里面放了生菜，让其更易入口。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_50",
      "hash64": "E4952FD826858A81",
      "text": "份量满分的三明治。\\n辣香肠的口感与味道十分出众。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_51",
      "hash64": "E4952ED8268588CE",
      "text": "淡淡的苦味诱人食欲。\\n吃起来十分有感觉的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_52",
      "hash64": "E4952DD82685871B",
      "text": "既健康又足量的三明治。\\n但味道好坏取决于土豆沙拉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_53",
      "hash64": "E4952CD826858568",
      "text": "虽然以蔬菜为主，但能吃得很满足的三明治。\\n牛油果即使稍微偏硬也不错。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_54",
      "hash64": "E49533D82685914D",
      "text": "这款三明治夹着种类丰富的蔬菜。\\n会吃的人喜欢将味调得偏浓。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_55",
      "hash64": "E49532D826858F9A",
      "text": "土豆沙拉三明治的完美版本。\\n味道的关键取决于带甜味的调味料。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_56",
      "hash64": "E49531D826858DE7",
      "text": "靠辛辣的酱汁带出了\\n蔬菜鲜甜的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_57",
      "hash64": "E49530D826858C34",
      "text": "一款青椒的苦味与辛辣的\\n酱汁十分搭配的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_58",
      "hash64": "E49527D826857CE9",
      "text": "能让人摄取足够蔬菜的三明治，\\n辛辣的酱汁带出了蔬菜的鲜味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_59",
      "hash64": "E49526D826857B36",
      "text": "辣味和酸味的平衡绝佳，\\n会让人吃不停的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_60",
      "hash64": "E49835D82687CA8A",
      "text": "这款三明治朴素的味道为人喜爱。\\n能够享受蛋原本的美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_61",
      "hash64": "E49836D82687CC3D",
      "text": "洋葱的甜味与口感带出了\\n蛋的美味，十分好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_62",
      "hash64": "E49833D82687C724",
      "text": "若吃腻了朴素的蛋三明治，就该吃这个。\\n芝士与蛋搭配得天衣无缝。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_63",
      "hash64": "E49834D82687C8D7",
      "text": "蛋三明治的完美版本。\\n浓厚的咸味是重点。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_64",
      "hash64": "E49831D82687C3BE",
      "text": "馅料满满的三明治。\\n饱腹感十足，很受年轻人欢迎。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_65",
      "hash64": "E49832D82687C571",
      "text": "调味料风味怡人的三明治。\\n烘蛋热乎乎的十分好吃哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_66",
      "hash64": "E4982FD82687C058",
      "text": "吃起来十分有感觉的三明治。\\n推荐选用后熟程度好的牛油果。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_67",
      "hash64": "E49830D82687C20B",
      "text": "份量满分的三明治。\\n苦味让整体味道变得和谐。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_68",
      "hash64": "E4982DD82687BCF2",
      "text": "吃起来就像在吃沙拉的三明治。\\n番茄够多，对身体很好哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_69",
      "hash64": "E4982ED82687BEA5",
      "text": "十分健康的三明治。\\n奇异果的酸味发挥得淋漓尽致。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_70",
      "hash64": "E49B9BD8268AADB3",
      "text": "只夹了蔬菜和水果的三明治。\\n即使并非爱吃蔬菜，也十分推荐。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_71",
      "hash64": "E49B9AD8268AAC00",
      "text": "调味以酸味为主，再对馅料添加辣味，\\n令整个味道变得会让人上瘾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_72",
      "hash64": "E49B9DD8268AB119",
      "text": "正宗传统的三明治。\\n主流而普通的味道绝对不会有错。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_73",
      "hash64": "E49B9CD8268AAF66",
      "text": "这款培根生菜番茄三明治，\\n带着令人感觉有点奢侈的罗勒风味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_74",
      "hash64": "E49B9FD8268AB47F",
      "text": "加入了芝士提升口感。\\n这款三明治味道的平衡做到了极致。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_75",
      "hash64": "E49B9ED8268AB2CC",
      "text": "微微的甜味让所有馅料保持和谐，\\n如同奇迹一般的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_76",
      "hash64": "E49BA1D8268AB7E5",
      "text": "土豆沙拉在其中扮演着重要角色，\\n很好地中和了炸鱼片的油腻感。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_77",
      "hash64": "E49BA0D8268AB632",
      "text": "这款三明治，生菜新鲜的口感\\n与炸鱼片十分搭配。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_78",
      "hash64": "E49BA3D8268ABB4B",
      "text": "辣根清爽的辣味\\n令这款三明治很容易入口。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_79",
      "hash64": "E49BA2D8268AB998",
      "text": "加入了辣味十分易入口。\\n是一款完美的炸鱼片三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_80",
      "hash64": "E48431D826771AB4",
      "text": "廉价的味道造就出的最棒三明治。\\n蛋黄酱一定要加个够。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_81",
      "hash64": "E48432D826771C67",
      "text": "加入了两种火腿的三明治。\\n尽管味道有点腻口，但非常好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_82",
      "hash64": "E48433D826771E1A",
      "text": "这款三明治，小辣椒刺激的辣味\\n带出了火腿的鲜味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_83",
      "hash64": "E48434D826771FCD",
      "text": "咸味仿佛在轻抚舌头的究极火腿三明治。\\n放入了较多火腿，口感让人倍感幸福。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_84",
      "hash64": "E4842DD8267713E8",
      "text": "为爱吃芝士的人而制的三明治。\\n朴素的调味容易入口。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_85",
      "hash64": "E4842ED82677159B",
      "text": "吃上去十分实在的三明治。\\n稍硬的牛油果很好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_86",
      "hash64": "E4842FD82677174E",
      "text": "散发着诱人罗勒香味的三明治。\\n多下胡椒会让味道更加平衡和美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_87",
      "hash64": "E48430D826771901",
      "text": "这款三明治以强烈的咸味\\n带出了芝士的鲜香美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_88",
      "hash64": "E48429D826770D1C",
      "text": "以汉堡排为主角的三明治。\\n醋的酸味是重点。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_89",
      "hash64": "E4842AD826770ECF",
      "text": "以汉堡排为主角的三明治。\\n辣根的辣味是重点。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_90",
      "hash64": "E48737D826795ABD",
      "text": "以汉堡排为主角的三明治。\\n豆瓣菜的苦味是重点。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_91",
      "hash64": "E48736D82679590A",
      "text": "以汉堡排为主角的三明治。\\n调味料的甜味是重点。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_92",
      "hash64": "E48735D826795757",
      "text": "味道高雅的三明治。\\n调味料间的平衡很重要。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_93",
      "hash64": "E48734D8267955A4",
      "text": "味道清爽的三明治。\\n蔬菜不能放太多。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_94",
      "hash64": "E48733D8267953F1",
      "text": "味道优雅的三明治。\\n罗勒的香味与鱼片很搭配。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_95",
      "hash64": "E48732D82679523E",
      "text": "在部分人当中流传着这款三明治\\n是烟熏鱼片的究极食用方法的传闻。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_96",
      "hash64": "E48731D82679508B",
      "text": "加入了大量水果的三明治。其精髓在于\\n鲜奶油较少，能原汁原味品尝食材。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_97",
      "hash64": "E48730D826794ED8",
      "text": "像点心一样的三明治。\\n橘子酱不需多，足以增添风味即可。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_98",
      "hash64": "E4872FD826794D25",
      "text": "像甜品一样的三明治。\\n要注意不能放太多酸奶。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_99",
      "hash64": "E4872ED826794B72",
      "text": "拥有奢华味道的三明治。\\n要小心不能放太多调味料。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_100",
      "hash64": "11442949882E404F",
      "text": "能品尝到各种味道的三明治。\\n馅料的平衡请按个人喜好调整。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_101",
      "hash64": "11442849882E3E9C",
      "text": "土豆沙拉能令人饱腹感十足。\\n在年轻人里很受欢迎的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_102",
      "hash64": "11442B49882E43B5",
      "text": "放了汉堡排，份量充足。放了\\n较多调味料，很受年轻人欢迎。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_103",
      "hash64": "11442A49882E4202",
      "text": "以极致的苦味将馅料融合在一起，\\n深受懂吃的人欢迎。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_104",
      "hash64": "11442549882E3983",
      "text": "能吃个满足又低卡路里。\\n适合用来减肥的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_105",
      "hash64": "11442449882E37D0",
      "text": "辛辣的酱汁会让人上瘾，\\n较为面向大人的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_106",
      "hash64": "11442749882E3CE9",
      "text": "接近完美的三明治。\\n椒片的口感是其亮点。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_107",
      "hash64": "11442649882E3B36",
      "text": "这款三明治通过辛辣的味道\\n突出了馅料的鲜味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_108",
      "hash64": "11443149882E4DE7",
      "text": "与水果三明治很相似的三明治。\\n不同之处与亮点在于黄油。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_109",
      "hash64": "11443049882E4C34",
      "text": "为了带出馅料的甜味，\\n而加了少量盐的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_110",
      "hash64": "1140A349882B26C6",
      "text": "全靠罗勒轻微的苦味与风味，\\n这款三明治其他馅料更为突出。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_111",
      "hash64": "1140A449882B2879",
      "text": "使用酸味添加了风味的三明治。\\n调味料下极少量即可。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_112",
      "hash64": "1140A149882B2360",
      "text": "健康又多汁的三明治。\\n蔬菜的新鲜程度决定其味道。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_113",
      "hash64": "1140A249882B2513",
      "text": "仅靠蔬菜制作而成的三明治。\\n其味道取决于调味料。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_114",
      "hash64": "1140A749882B2D92",
      "text": "以蔬菜作为王牌的三明治。\\n多放豆瓣菜让味道统一。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_115",
      "hash64": "1140A849882B2F45",
      "text": "蔬菜三明治的完美形态。\\n其味道好坏大大取决于调味料的多少。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_116",
      "hash64": "1140A549882B2A2C",
      "text": "仅使用了能让人吃个满足的食材。\\n基本上这款三明治的着重点在于份量。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_117",
      "hash64": "1140A649882B2BDF",
      "text": "这款三明治的概念就是要让人吃个饱。\\n比起味道更加优先份量。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_118",
      "hash64": "1140AB49882B345E",
      "text": "追求能吃饱的三明治。\\n吃的时候要注意健康。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_119",
      "hash64": "1140AC49882B3611",
      "text": "因为酸味所以能简单入口，\\n但这款三明治的卡路里并没改变。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_120",
      "hash64": "113D3D498828439D",
      "text": "正如其名字，是款面向大人的三明治。\\n较辣的蔬菜可是成熟的象征。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_121",
      "hash64": "113D3C49882841EA",
      "text": "调味料之间难以取得平衡的三明治。\\n罗勒的香味诱人食欲。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_122",
      "hash64": "113D3B4988284037",
      "text": "加入了辣味，变得更有成熟的滋味了。\\n不是人人都能吃下的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_123",
      "hash64": "113D3A4988283E84",
      "text": "基本上以辣味为主的三明治。\\n无法推荐给受不了刺激的人。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_124",
      "hash64": "113D394988283CD1",
      "text": "这款三明治以蔬菜为中心。\\n独特的酱汁十分刺激。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_125",
      "hash64": "113D384988283B1E",
      "text": "蔬菜担任主角的三明治。\\n放入小黄瓜之后就马上吃掉吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_126",
      "hash64": "113D37498828396B",
      "text": "献给爱吃蔬菜的人的三明治。\\n蛋黄酱的量能添加风味便够了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_127",
      "hash64": "113D3649882837B8",
      "text": "为蔬菜而创作出的三明治。\\n轻微的甜味能够衬托出蔬菜的鲜味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_128",
      "hash64": "113D354988283605",
      "text": "黄油的甜味与辣根的辣味\\n配搭得很棒的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_129",
      "hash64": "113D344988283452",
      "text": "牛油果的味道十分浓郁的三明治。\\n味道取决于所用水果的平衡。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_130",
      "hash64": "1139B74988252A14",
      "text": "甜与辣的平衡最为重要。\\n多放芝士会很好吃哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_131",
      "hash64": "1139B84988252BC7",
      "text": "暗藏的苦味令这款三明治\\n甜辣的味道变得和谐。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_132",
      "hash64": "1139B94988252D7A",
      "text": "因为馅料的味道很强烈，\\n所以这款三明治少下调味料更好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_133",
      "hash64": "1139BA4988252F2D",
      "text": "所用食材豪华且贵重的三明治。\\n靠豆腐而增加了口感。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_134",
      "hash64": "1139B34988252348",
      "text": "食材上难以取得平衡的三明治。\\n味道调得比较浓会更好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_135",
      "hash64": "1139B449882524FB",
      "text": "此三明治用最上等的辣味将充满个性的\\n食材们整合了起来，乃是一款杰作。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_136",
      "hash64": "1139B549882526AE",
      "text": "食谱由豆腐爱好者发明。\\n份量十足的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_137",
      "hash64": "1139B64988252861",
      "text": "制作难度稍高的三明治。\\n豆腐的水分要充分去掉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_138",
      "hash64": "1139AF4988251C7C",
      "text": "味道清淡的豆腐与豆瓣菜的苦味\\n很搭配的神奇三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_139",
      "hash64": "1139B04988251E2F",
      "text": "这款三明治通过贵重调味料的咸味，\\n让蕴藏在豆腐中的鲜味绽放出了光彩。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_140",
      "hash64": "113631498822108B",
      "text": "充满挑战精神的三明治。\\n咖喱粉要稍微炒过再使用。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_141",
      "hash64": "1136304988220ED8",
      "text": "这款三明治以小辣椒刺激的辣味\\n突出了咖喱的风味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_142",
      "hash64": "11363349882213F1",
      "text": "蛋让本来辛辣的味道\\n变得十分柔和。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_143",
      "hash64": "113632498822123E",
      "text": "美味与否取决于淡淡的甜味。\\n味道酝酿出了底蕴与层次感。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_144",
      "hash64": "1136354988221757",
      "text": "极为暴力的三明治。\\n份量才是正义。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_145",
      "hash64": "11363449882215A4",
      "text": "想法以份量为中心的三明治。\\n而对味道并无什么特别需要提及的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_146",
      "hash64": "1136374988221ABD",
      "text": "只执着于份量的三明治。\\n根据调味也能做得美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_147",
      "hash64": "113636498822190A",
      "text": "托调味料的福，这款三明治\\n不仅份量大，味道也不错。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_148",
      "hash64": "11362949882202F3",
      "text": "以寿司为目标做出的三明治。\\n味道意外地好，希望这能让人惊讶。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_149",
      "hash64": "1136284988220140",
      "text": "参考寿司制作出的三明治。\\n豆瓣菜的苦味很突出。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_150",
      "hash64": "11332B49881FD082",
      "text": "寿司爱好者想出来的三明治。\\n其份量也是魅力之一。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_151",
      "hash64": "11332C49881FD235",
      "text": "完美的寿司三明治。\\n清爽的酸味堪称极品。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
